# Values for `minimal.secrets`, so it can stand up unattended.
#
# Committed on purpose. These are throwaway values for a throwaway local lab
# that exists to demonstrate the projection path; nothing here guards anything.
# A lab someone lives in uses a `sops` store and commits the encrypted file
# instead — see `lab.secrets.stores.<n>.backend`.
#
# The variable names are derived, not declared:
# `CATA_SECRET_<STORE>__<SECRET>__<KEY>`, uppercased, with every character that
# is not a letter or a digit replaced by an underscore. Print them with
# `cata --flake .#minimal.secrets secrets generate --format env`.
CATA_SECRET_APP__APP_CREDENTIALS__API_TOKEN='not-a-real-token'
CATA_SECRET_APP__APP_CREDENTIALS__SESSION_KEY='Pf+Y3YRtIH3oHZYeGxiW2c+1Rr/LkF1y2XAVF0f499c='
